eternity.abilities.tessellation.desc=A grid of golden tiles where you look; the lit ones erupt, then all the others.
eternity.abilities.alignment.name=Alignment
eternity.abilities.alignment.desc=A golden line along your gaze; everything near is drawn into it, then judgement runs its length.
eternity.abilities.dice.name=The Dice
eternity.abilities.dice.desc=Roll two dice of deep space where you look, and live with whatever they show.
eternity.abilities.maw.name=The Maw
eternity.abilities.maw.desc=Inhale the world for a few seconds; whatever reaches you is bitten.
eternity.abilities.wanderers.name=Wanderers
eternity.abilities.wanderers.desc=Little rifts of deep space set loose where you look, wandering at random.
eternity.abilities.disarray.name=Disarray
eternity.abilities.disarray.desc=Everything near where you look forgets whose side it is on, and turns on its neighbours.
eternity.abilities.inversion.name=Inversion
eternity.abilities.inversion.desc=You and whatever you look at trade places.
eternity.abilities.equilibrium.name=Equilibrium
eternity.abilities.equilibrium.desc=The health of whatever you look at becomes the health it lacks.
eternity.abilities.paradox.name=Paradox
eternity.abilities.paradox.desc=For everything around you, up and down trade places, and then trade back.
